- API credentials (see `.env.example`)

---

## Setup

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 2. Set up credentials
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env and fill in your Azure OpenAI / OpenAI API key
```

---

## Running the PoC

```bash
# User-data mode: place your input file in sample_input/ first
python run_poc.py

# Synthetic-data mode (generates sample input for document/RAG patterns;
# audio patterns cannot be auto-generated -- place a real audio file in sample_input/):
python run_poc.py --synthetic
```

Results are written to `output/`.

